  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Afghan Citizens Resettlement Scheme (ACRS) ODA spend on benefits</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DWP&apos;s ODA spend for Afghan nationals and eligible family members who have arrived under the Afghan Citizens Resettlement Scheme. The benefits that count under ODA and therefore make up the spend are Universal Credit, Pension Credit, Attendance Allowance, Personal Independence Payments and child Disability Living Allowance.</narrative>
  </description>
